      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-12-14T23:34:28.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I enjoyed it a lot, now that we're discussing. I totaly didn't think of the fact those were Haka's that he was doing!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do agree that the songs weren't quite as memorable as some previous disney movies. And given that it wasn't really a Villain does bad things we have to stop them story, but rather a 'This is a story of finding out who you really are,' it feels... well just different than most disney movies.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I haven't seen Kubo and the Two STrings yet Rabbit, but I really really want to.&nbsp;</p>",
